<title>MALTA: PRESS DIGEST - Malta - Oct 25.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Malta - Oct 25.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the leading stories in the Maltese press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THE TIMES</p>
<p>- All set for Saturday's elections; early indication of results expected late on Sunday.</p>
<p>- Sharp rise in number of unwed mothers.</p>
<p>L-ORIZZONT</p>
<p>- Australian High Commission might close for economy reasons; move would be blow for Malta which has some 200,000 Maltese emigrants in Australia.</p>
</text>
